          "body": "<div style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size:14px; line-height:1.4; color:#111;\">\n  <p>Hello <strong>{{issue.assignee.displayName}}</strong>,</p>\n\n  <p>\n    This is an automatic reminder that\n    <strong>{{issue.key}} - {{issue.summary}}</strong>\n    is scheduled for automatic closure on\n    <strong>{{issue.customfield_15727.minusDays(10).format(\"MMMM d, yyyy\")}}</strong>.\n  </p>\n\n  <p>Please take any necessary actions before the closure date.</p>\n\n  <p>\n    <strong>Issue Link:</strong>\n    <a href=\"{{issue.url}}\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">\n      <strong>{{issue.key}}</strong> - View issue\n    </a>\n  </p>\n</div>",
          "bodyType": "HTML",
          "emailName": "Auto-Closure Notifications",
          "fromEmailAddress": "automation@ford-advev.atlassian.net",
